<title>USA: ARCO Chemical completes plastics sale.</title>
<headline>ARCO Chemical completes plastics sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ARCO Chemical Co said Tuesday it completed the sale of its plastics business to NOVA Chemicals Inc, a subsidiary of NOVA Corp, for about US$160 million.</p>
<p>&quot;We are pleased to have closed this transaction on the timetable we set at the time of our announcement&quot; in June, the company commented.  -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
